<title>HONG KONG: Bank Bira sets US$80 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank Bira sets US$80 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue has been launched, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK INDONESIA RAYA (BANK BIRA) ACTING THROUGH</p>
<p>	    ITS COOK ISLANDS BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT	US$80 MLN   COUPON    6ML+90     MATURITY    2 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     13.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	10/100K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS --	   PAY DATE    23.DEC.96</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY INDONESIA  TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  SNR CO-LEADS US$6 MLN+  90 BP ALL-IN 135</p>
<p>			    CO-LEADS     US$3-5 MLN 80 BP ALL-IN 130</p>
<p>			    CO-MANAGERS  US$1-2 MLN 70 BP ALL-IN 125</p>
<p>ARRANGER  AMERICAN EXPRESS BANK, ARAB BANKING CORP (BSC)</p>
<p>	     SINGAPORE, BNP SINGAPORE, BANK BOSTON, DRESDNER</p>
<p>	     SOUTHEAST ASIA, KANGWON BANK, MERRILL LYNCH FAR</p>
<p>	     EAST (SOLE BOOKS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
